    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663680/extras/afb19c9fb67b0b1d936e33a5cb58d81f.avif?t=1752588051\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KORI is a psychedelic puzzle game set in an empty world approaching the end of its cycle. Players control Kore, the main character that exists only within shadows, who triggers the beginning of a new cycle by interacting with the lingering residues of life residing in shadows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663680/extras/37170877e624ce408c65038ec62e1cf5.poster.avif?t=1752588051\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663680/extras/37170877e624ce408c65038ec62e1cf5.webm?t=1752588051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663680/extras/37170877e624ce408c65038ec62e1cf5.mp4?t=1752588051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Use shadow manipulation mechanics to Progress and unravel the secrets hidden in shadows </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663680/extras/afb19c9fb67b0b1d936e33a5cb58d81f.avif?t=1752588051\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KORI is a psychedelic puzzle game set in an empty world approaching the end of its cycle. Players control Kore, the main character that exists only within shadows, who triggers the beginning of a new cycle by interacting with the lingering residues of life residing in shadows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663680/extras/37170877e624ce408c65038ec62e1cf5.poster.avif?t=1752588051\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663680/extras/37170877e624ce408c65038ec62e1cf5.webm?t=1752588051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663680/extras/37170877e624ce408c65038ec62e1cf5.mp4?t=1752588051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Use shadow manipulation mechanics to Progress and unravel the secrets hidden in shadows </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
